        "t": "text",
        "v": " to the last block that is identical across requests. Second failure: a prompt below the model minimum caches silently and returns no error — 512 tokens on Opus 5, Fable 5, Fable 5.1, Mythos 5 and Mythos 5.1; 1,024 on Sonnet 5, Opus 4.8, and Sonnet 4.x; 2,048 on Opus 4.7; 4,096 on Opus 4.6, Opus 4.5, and Haiku 4.5. [1]"
