        "t": "text",
        "v": " Anthropic's own measurement is blunt: \"a multi-model configuration that looked cheaper than the default single model cost more than that same model at lower effort.\" Sweep effort on your eval and plot accuracy against cost before you add a second model or drop a tier. [8]"
