      "v": [
       {
        "t": "strong",
        "v": "Where it goes wrong."
       },
       {
        "t": "text",
        "v": " A team varies effort per turn inside one long conversation on a model without per-message effort, destroys the cache on every change, and spends more than the effort reduction saved. Another team carries effort settings across a model upgrade; the docs say to run a fresh sweep instead, because the levels do not map across generations. [3]"
       }
      ]
